{
  "case_id": "SS-SHARED-1.21.1",
  "title": "飞星筹码冒烟：两枚同装的共享计时器与「先紫后金、命中后隔 1 秒」齐射时序",
  "version": "1.21.1",
  "target": {
    "type": "feature",
    "ref": "shooting-star-shared-cooldown"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "目的：两枚飞星**同时装备**时 —— ① 共享同一计时器（一次触发即写同一冷却键）；② 依次下落（先紫色、命中后隔 1 秒落金色）。判据：一次 `ssfire` 之后，靶子先掉 1 点（紫）、再掉 2 点（金）共 3 点；星光一次触发累计 +2。"
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "前置：装钻石骰子（2+ chip 槽，需同时装两枚）；星光置 0；`ssclear` 复位。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamemode survival",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/time set midnight",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/gamerule doDaylightCycle false",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot dice \"astral_dice:diamond_dice\" S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe equipslot chip \"astral_dice:purple_shooting_star_chip\" S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 300
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe slotput S2 chip 1 \"astral_dice:golden_shooting_star_chip\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe signprep S2 \"astral_dice:sherry_sign\" 0",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssspawn S2 plain",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 500
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "触发一次：两个 Pending 应同时入队（紫 t=0→20、金 t=40→60）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssfire S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "t≈0.4s：粒子仍在飞行 → 靶子应**还是满血**（证明伤害在落地后才结算）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 700
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "t≈1.6s：紫色已落地（-1），金色仍在飞行 → 靶子 19、星光 1。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "t≈3.5s：金色已落地（-2）→ 靶子 17、星光 2（一次触发累计 +2 ⇒ 共享计时器）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 600
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "诊断追加：+3 秒后再读一次 —— 若此处 star=2 / hp=17，说明齐射只是比断言窗口晚落地，而非没有落地（本步不加断言，只留读数）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 3000
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssread S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralprobe ssclear S2",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/clear @s",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 400
    }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_S2_SSREAD:star=0:.*:t_hp=20[^:]*:.*:t_elite=0"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_S2_SSFIRE:now=[0-9]+:cd_product=[0-9]+:cd_delta=200:cd_started=1"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_S2_SSREAD:star=0:.*:t_hp=20[^:]*:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_S2_SSREAD:star=1:.*:t_hp=19[^:]*:"
    },
    {
      "type": "log",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_S2_SSREAD:star=2:.*:t_hp=17[^:]*:"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_ERR"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "AP_[A-Z0-9]+_EX:"
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": ":err="
    },
    {
      "type": "absent",
      "source": "latest",
      "pattern": "参数后应有空格分隔|未知或不完整的命令|Unknown or incomplete command|Incorrect argument"
    },
    {
      "type": "kubejs"
    },
    {
      "type": "crash"
    }
  ]
}